        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "I have been a client for over 3 years and for the most part happy despite annual increases on premiums (never made a claim), BUT recently I went to purchase Home insurance with them and there and I was in a time crunch, at first they gave me a quick quote but have since ghosted me.\n\nI have called four times, only once getting through to one broker who couldn't help me and said call again. I have sent a few e-mails with no response. I literally wanted to give them my business but couldn't reach an agent to make a purchase (horrible business model), I have since shopped around and found better products elsewhere as I couldn't waste anymore time.",
